{"name": "Tower Command", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"285\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/500daa9c20770a474bfcda71c997db2d.avif?t=1784927483\" width=\"1280\"/></span>In the beginning, various sightings\u00a0were reported of abnormal creatures roaming the countryside. Not long after, the creatures started to attack the villages and cities. Chaos quickly broke out as the packs of beasts grew to hordes. While the kingdoms are strained to survive, the mystery of who or what is behind this onslaught remains to be solved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/96ee584be60826cbd78202e864af407f.avif?t=1784927483\" width=\"1280\"/></span>Tower Command is a tower defense with high level of strategy and tactics. Build towers to maximize bonuses and synergies to stop the waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select a commander, towers, traits and items to fit your strategy. Each tower is unique and can give bonuses to nearby towers, so place them wisely.   Try to survive as long as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/d458a4d6712a299fb37f6056ee53e55e.avif?t=1784927483\" width=\"1280\"/></span>All towers are unique. They vary in attack behavior, many have special passives and abilities and can give various bonuses to nearby towers. Gain experience and upgrade your towers to maximize their effectiveness. Combine upgrades and bonuses in effective ways to create crazy combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"330\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/4734543d2b5a73fc4f373f5aa3d82cc3.poster.avif?t=1784927483\" width=\"724\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/4734543d2b5a73fc4f373f5aa3d82cc3.webm?t=1784927483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/4734543d2b5a73fc4f373f5aa3d82cc3.mp4?t=1784927483\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/092d703c312b9b2654d7991ea0c7e73a.avif?t=1784927483\" width=\"1280\"/></span>During the game, you gain experience and can use this to upgrade your towers with a wide range of upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"160\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/9ce3d079bfebb67b12f6218e09036e80.avif?t=1784927483\" width=\"936\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/fbe264794a325e194312eaaadc9d07f2.avif?t=1784927483\" width=\"1280\"/></span>Certain towers have link bonuses. These bones applies to nearby towers. Decide where to place your towers to maximize the damage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"272\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/0c021a81a24a9802c0476c81c97b1444.avif?t=1784927483\" width=\"738\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/3daf32eca9bef8d8ba7270f16f73087a.avif?t=1784927483\" width=\"1280\"/></span>By playing you can complete various challenges to unlock new commanders, traits, items, towers and maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"254\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/1e86b5e4b1626584f732beff3c8282e0.avif?t=1784927483\" width=\"954\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/e056be9e0f78935138643f0746db9c6b.avif?t=1784927483\" width=\"1280\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items can be found during each run, some can provide global bonuses, some can be activated and some can be placed on towers to give them unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"342\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/6e898b581934c4ec5303feb58b90d99b.avif?t=1784927483\" width=\"1280\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/93a1f350e96cf05a73f284456a3f5f25.avif?t=1784927483\" width=\"1280\"/></span>There are multiple playable maps, each with a unique look and layout and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"342\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/d24bb222b38105af7a40a4c8f7c69cc5.avif?t=1784927483\" width=\"1280\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/6818de923772924164e217b250fcb197.avif?t=1784927483\" width=\"1280\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies have dynamic pathfinding, so there is no fixed path they take to their goal. Use this to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"254\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/5df75fa81a3e415eb22ecc02e73e8590.avif?t=1784927483\" width=\"954\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/e2e53ffda1d67ac365e8038f2234fa03.avif?t=1784927483\" width=\"1280\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your defense from by choosing from a wide range of unique towers. Stop the enemies from reaching their destination. Placement is key!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/7552acdde1df45fb33dbb8bd9c5d070a.avif?t=1784927483\" width=\"1280\"/></span>Choose a strategy and survive as long as possible! Each run is different!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/c6dc2786d48416cc535593befa4442fd.avif?t=1784927483\" width=\"1280\"/></span>Each map has a final boss. But you can choose to keep playing after defeating this boss to continue in an \"endless\" mode where new waves will spawn to test how far you can really go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/extras/50f8268bf688e8d767966d741f28fbef.avif?t=1784927483\" width=\"1280\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Music:</strong>\u00a0AlkaKrab</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Strategic tower defense where you need to maximize your bonuses. Create your build, upgrade towers, link them, equip items to create ridiculous combos. Placement is key in this game, you decide the path enemies take to their goal. Explore all maps and unlock towers, commanders, traits and items.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719660/a50b922be50dbeb66917592650479a353d2e1cb1/header.jpg?t=1784927483", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Tactical", "Base Building", "Action", "Casual", "Turn-Based Tactics"], "developers": "RILE Games", "publishers": "RILE Games", "release_date": "Jul 15, 2026", "price": "$5.39", "appid": "3719660", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "15 July 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/MbfTX4VAU4o", "first_seen": 1784066400.0, "review_rank": 286}